{"repositoryId":1370254698,"availability":"available","full":"wellorgs/fileshare","name":"fileshare","description":"Free peer-to-peer file transfer in the browser — AirDrop/Nearby Share alternative, no app, no upload, no size limit, works across networks via WebRTC","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-14T16:51:28Z","updated":"2026-09-22T11:37:17Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://wellorgs.github.io/fileshare/","topics":["airdrop","airdrop-alternative","browser-based","cross-platform","file-sharing","file-transfer","fileshare","javascript","large-file-transfer","nearby-share","no-install","no-upload","p2p","peer-to-peer","privacy","qr-code","webapp","webrtc"],"demo":"https://wellorgs.github.io/fileshare/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:34:01.689Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T19:34:01.689Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T19:34:01.689Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T19:34:01.689Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Send files from one device to another, in real time. Private, peer to peer, no size limit.","FileShare is a free, private way to send files straight from one device to another. Think of it as an AirDrop or Nearby Share that works between any two devices: Windows, Mac, Linux, iPhone, iPad, or Android, on the same WiFi or across completely different networks. Open the page on two devices, connect with a 6 digit code or a QR scan, and drag a file over. It travels directly from one device to the other, end to end encrypted. Nothing is ever uploaded to a server.","It's useful for sending files between Windows, Mac, Linux, iPhone, iPad, and Android without installing anything, sending large files like videos or ISOs without a slow cloud upload and download round trip or a file size cap, moving files between a phone and a laptop that are on completely different networks, and as a quick, private alternative to email attachments, USB drives, or cloud storage links."],"features":["Direct P2P transfer, end to end encrypted. WebRTC data channels, encrypted by default. No file ever touches a server; the room code is only used to set up the connection.","Works on any network. Same WiFi or LAN goes direct. Different networks fall back through a relay automatically, no VPN or port forwarding needed.","Room code and QR join. No accounts, no pairing dance.","Multi device rooms. A host sees every joined device. Click one to target it, or hit All to send to every connected device at once.","Folders. Drag a folder in, or pick one from the file picker's dropdown. The whole structure sends natively and lands back in the same folder layout, no zipping needed."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wellorgs/fileshare/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"e04de4765927027028c25582bde36449fda054cb2192350e8dd65eb7faf388f2","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T19:34:01.908Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:34:01.908Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Send files from one device to another, in real time. Private, peer to peer, no size limit.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wellorgs/fileshare/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"It's useful for sending files between Windows, Mac, Linux, iPhone, iPad, and Android without installing anything, sending large files like videos or ISOs without a slow cloud upload and download round trip or a file size cap, moving files between a phone and a laptop that are on completely different networks, and as a quick, private alternative to email attachments, USB…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wellorgs/fileshare/blob/master/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No accounts, no pairing dance.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wellorgs/fileshare/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No accounts, no analytics, no server side storage.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wellorgs/fileshare/blo